OL,3,ABrit School North arts college plan
OL,4,Agiven go-ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project, which has been approved by
OL,7,FBradford Council, is spearheaded by the
OL,8,FBritish Phonographic Industry (BPI) who
OL,9,Fare owners and organisers of the music
OL,10,Fshowcase, the Brit Awards.
